            <ArticleTitle>NSAIDs, musculoskeletal disorders and gastrointestinal adverse effects.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1735-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Paracetamol should be considered as first line treatment for the common painful musculoskeletal disorders, especially osteoarthrosis. NSAIDs, which are beneficial should this fail and inflammation be present, should be prescribed in the lowest dose for the shortest possible time.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
